  "description": "\"If you were a woman, I would have asked you to date me right away...\"\n\"I'm glad you're you...\"\n\nHyeon-Jun is going through his millionth breakup and is being comforted by his friend In-Ho, whom he has known for 17 years. In-Ho, who has had a crush on Hyeon-Jun for several years, instantly confesses and the two quickly become more than friends. Hyeon-Jun, who's confused about his sexuality, starts a contract relationship with In-Ho...\n\nHyeon-Jun is excited about dating In-ho, and while wondering if he can like another man, goes to a gay bar, where he meets Yu-Min...\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)",
